18 teams competed in the league&nbsp;– the top 15 teams from the previous season and the 3 teams promoted from the [[2023–24 Saudi First Division League|FD League]].

===Teams who were promoted to the Pro League===
On 6 May 2024, [[Al Qadsiah FC|Al-Qadsiah]] became the first team to be promoted following a 2–2 draw with [[Ohod Club|Ohod]].<ref>{{cite web |title=بعد 3 أعوام.. القادسية يعود إلى "روشن" |url=https://arriyadiyah.com/839430}}</ref> They were crowned champions following a 4–2 win against [[Al-Najma SC (Saudi Arabia)|Al-Najma]] on 13 May 2024.<ref>{{cite web |title=يلو.. القادسية يضرب بالأربعة ويتوّج بطلا |url=https://arriyadiyah.com/839984}}</ref> Al-Qadsiah returned to the top flight after an absence of three seasons and played in their 37th season in the top flight.

On 21 May 2024, [[Al-Kholood Club|Al-Kholood]] and [[Al-Orobah FC|Al-Orobah]] became the final two clubs to be promoted. Al-Kholood were promoted following a 5–1 win against [[Al Safa FC|Al-Safa]].<ref>{{cite web |title="دوري الأولى السعودي": صعود تاريخي للخلود و العروبة إلى "روشن" |url=https://aawsat.com/%D8%A7%D9%84%D8%B1%D9%8A%D8%A7%D8%B6%D8%A9/%D8%B1%D9%8A%D8%A7%D8%B6%D8%A9-%D8%B3%D8%B9%D9%88%D8%AF%D9%8A%D8%A9/5023105-%D8%AF%D9%88%D8%B1%D9%8A-%D8%A7%D9%84%D8%A3%D9%88%D9%84%D9%89-%D8%A7%D9%84%D8%B3%D8%B9%D9%88%D8%AF%D9%8A-%D8%B5%D8%B9%D9%88%D8%AF-%D8%AA%D8%A7%D8%B1%D9%8A%D8%AE%D9%8A-%D9%84%D9%84%D8%AE%D9%84%D9%88%D8%AF-%D9%88-%D8%A7%D9%84%D8%B9%D8%B1%D9%88%D8%A8%D8%A9-%D8%A5%D9%84%D9%89-%D8%B1%D9%88%D8%B4%D9%86}}</ref> Al-Kholood played in the top flight of Saudi football for the first time in history and became the 38th side to participate in the Saudi Pro League since its inception.

Al-Orobah were promoted following a 1–0 win against [[Al-Jabalain FC|Al-Jabalain]].<ref>{{cite web |title=بعد 10 أعوام.. العروبة يعود إلى "المحترفين" |url=https://arriyadiyah.com/840625}}</ref> Al-Orobah returned to the top flight for the first time since getting relegated in the [[2014–15 Saudi Pro League|2014–15 season]] and played in their 3rd season in the top flight.

===Teams who were relegated to the FD League===
[[Al-Hazem F.C.|Al-Hazem]] were the first team to be relegated following a 4–1 home defeat to [[Al Hilal SFC|Al-Hilal]] on 11 May 2024.<ref>{{cite web |title="بالركاده".... الهلال يحسم الدوري ويصادق على هبوط الحزم |url=https://al-hadath.com/sport-news/72144/%D8%A8%D8%A7%D9%84%D8%B1%D9%83%D8%A7%D8%AF%D9%87-%D8%A7%D9%84%D9%87%D9%84%D8%A7%D9%84-%D9%8A%D8%AD%D8%B3%D9%85-%D8%A7%D9%84%D8%AF%D9%88%D8%B1%D9%8A-%D9%88%D9%8A%D8%B5%D8%A7%D8%AF%D9%82-%D8%B9%D9%84%D9%89-%D9%87%D8%A8%D9%88%D8%B7-%D8%A7%D9%84%D8%AD%D8%B2%D9%85}}</ref> Al-Hazem were relegated after just one year in the top flight. This was their third relegation in five years.

Both [[Abha Club|Abha]] and [[Al-Tai FC|Al-Tai]] were relegated on the final day of the season. Abha were relegated following a 2–1 defeat away to Al-Hazem.<ref>{{cite web |title=بعد 5 مواسم.. الحزم يسحب أبها إلى يلو |url=https://arriyadiyah.com/841096}}</ref> Abha were relegated after five consecutive seasons in the Pro League.

[[Al-Tai FC|Al-Tai]] were relegated following a 2–0 home defeat to [[Al-Okhdood Club|Al-Okhdood]].<ref>{{cite web |title=الطائي يهبط .. والأخدود يفلت |date=27 May 2024 |url=https://www.alyaum.com/article/6532295}}</ref> Al-Tai were relegated after three consecutive seasons in the top flight.

